  "workflow_name": "Phonon dispersion from EAM/MEAM potentials",
  "definition": "Calculate phonon dispersion curves for metals using the embedded atom method (EAM) or modified embedded atom method (MEAM) potential. The workflow involves defining the total energy functional, fitting potential parameters to bulk properties (lattice constant, cohesive energy, elastic constants, vacancy formation energy), computing force constants from second derivatives of the total energy, constructing the dynamical matrix, diagonalizing to obtain phonon frequencies, and comparing with experimental phonon dispersion data.",
